### IT Access Request Portal - sample requests (direct to Spring Boot)
### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension or IntelliJ's HTTP client.
### X-Demo-* headers are the development-only role switch (see DemoHeaderUserResolver).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health (also checks the Oracle connection)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Submit a request (employee) -> 201 + Location header
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/requests
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-User: ted.l
X-Demo-Role: EMPLOYEE

{
  "requesterName": "Ted L",
  "systemName": "GitLab",
  "accessLevel": "WRITE",
  "reason": "Need to push feature branches for the billing project"
}

### Validation error -> 400 problem detail with "errors"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requesterName": "",
  "systemName": "GitLab",
  "reason": "short"
}

### List, filtered by status and text (requester or system name, case-insensitive)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/requests?status=PENDING&q=git&page=0&size=20

### Details (request + history via one JOIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/requests/1

### History only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/requests/1/history

### Approve (admin) -> 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/requests/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-User: alice.admin
X-Demo-Role: ADMIN

{
  "status": "APPROVED",
  "comment": "Approved for Q4"
}

### Review again -> 409 Conflict (no longer PENDING)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/requests/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-User: alice.admin
X-Demo-Role: ADMIN

{
  "status": "REJECTED"
}

### Review as employee -> 403
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/requests/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-User: ted.l

{
  "status": "APPROVED"
}

### Hikari pool metrics (dev profile only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/hikaricp.connections.active
